WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:07.414
Draw Again tells you what happens after the next shape.
Choose Ellipse. The dock says it will switch back to Select.

2
00:00:07.915 --> 00:00:11.607
Turn on Draw Again. Now the dock says you'll stay on
Ellipse.

3
00:00:12.108 --> 00:00:15.200
Draw five circles without touching the toolbar again.

4
00:00:20.554 --> 00:00:24.271
Five circles are on the canvas, and Ellipse is still
selected.
